[en.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY]
Magical Theory Progress

[en.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY_desc]
We have made some progress in magical theory. Our scientists and students are at the forefront of the times. However, we have not yet figured out how to apply these theories to actual production.

[en.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY_o0]
Advance applications

[zh.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY]
魔法理论进步

[zh.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY_desc]
在魔法理论方面，我们取得了一些进步。我们的科学家和学生们走在了时代的前沿。不过目前为止，我们还并没有想清楚如何将这些理论应用到实际生产中。

[zh.SP_REWARD_GENERIC_MAGIC_THEORY_o0]
